+## Nested symbolic list inputs
+
+```catala
+declaration structure Box:
+  data values content list of integer
+
+declaration scope NestedListInput:
+  input box content Box
+  output length content integer
+
+scope NestedListInput:
+  definition length equals number of box.values
+
+declaration scope ListOfListsInput:
+  input values content list of list of integer
+  output outer_length content integer
+  output flattened_length content integer
+
+scope ListOfListsInput:
+  definition outer_length equals number of values
+  definition flattened_length equals
+    number of (combine all inner among values in acc initially []
+               with acc ++ inner)
+```
+
+```catala-test-cli
+$ catala Concolic --conc-max-list-length=2 -s NestedListInput
+┌─[RESULT]─
+│ 
+└─
+┌─[RESULT]─
